> Unfiltered prior decoding and a fixed latent grid

Twenty explicit standard-normal prior codes use seed2069 and no image, label or posterior
input. The complete prior gallery shows sigmoid probabilities, not sampled Bernoulli pixels.
The81-point grid uses z_x from−2 to2 left to right and z_y from2 to−2 top to bottom, step0.5.
It is a decoder inspection, not a data embedding or proof of semantic axes. Every output keeps
the same[0,1]gray range; none is selected or normalized by visual quality.

